# Files that ship into Linux containers / CI must stay LF even on Windows
# checkouts with core.autocrlf=true (CRLF breaks shebangs: "bash\r: not found").
# Added 2026-10-27 (pipeline-freshness fixes), mirroring google-ads-meta-ads-engine.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
